{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5b12e9a87f5907ef2b0218e4e233d085ebe5ca849ccc7ceb58e771cc11afa428", "ja": "（金沢での春香達の公演が終了し、ステージ衣装用に\nレンタルしていた、加賀友禅の着物を返しに来た）", "zh": "（春香她们在金泽的公演结束之后，\n我前来归还租来当作表演服装的加贺友禅和服。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3437a8304f2cb56a436e52be9c80cc5b5e9fea0d439c4be3e035e29b329f93e8", "ja": "（それにしても社長の知り合いの店だけあって、\nいい着物が安く借りられたな。助かった……）", "zh": "（不过还真庆幸，这家店是社长朋友开的，\n才能让我用便宜价格租到高级的和服，省下不少钱……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7333f1981f570d63dd561c99d61f3d2e32ddd78233f22cefed014ddd5a1d7d84", "ja": "（おっと、もうすぐ帰りの新幹線が出てしまう！\n急がないと！）", "zh": "（糟糕，回程的新干线快开了！\n动作要快一点！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1bee3194d3e3976a3aa74b485c7c0071355676882ce9ac09392c49132161a87d", "ja": "すみませーん、765プロの者です！\n借りていた衣装をお返しに来たんですけど……。", "zh": "不好意思──我是765艺能的制作人！\n想要归还租借的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aea7db3974ef5018d455c2eb76a33c67a37582d25910a1c1dc04d851d1308dc2", "ja": "ようこそ、おいであそばせ。", "zh": "欢迎您的光临。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "07f43ca633f5df752275d531e8a961cc9f356e090db8c6f0d0da254f13ea840c", "ja": "生憎と今、父が留守にしているもので……\nご用件は私が承ります。", "zh": "但是很不凑巧，家父出门了……\n让我为您处理吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1007_p", "source_sha256": "28aca01c82fad74abd6affc6d9a058da62e36c53d73c34e5f9ea8de1a5cc82be", "ja": "（綺麗な子だな。艶のある髪に、透き通るような瞳。\n一度見たら、目が離せなくなってしまう……）", "zh": "（好漂亮的女孩。柔亮的秀发，清澈的眼神。\n一看到就移不开目光……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5611f6982135a64441ec088d3749c7118fb8a93fb6f25639065dadeda3068273", "ja": "765プロさん……お貸ししていた舞台衣装ですね。\nうちの着物、お客さま方には喜んでいただけましたか。", "zh": "765艺能事务所……租借的表演服装对吗？\n不知道观众满不满意我们店里的和服？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "23f8e1c2883efa91e1569c893abd8bb44ae87b9d4279297ab0316754e09e77ca", "ja": "（いや、外見だけじゃない。この子が話す言葉、\n持っている雰囲気。これは……）", "zh": "（不对，不只是外表而已。这女孩的言行举止、\n身上散发的气质。这是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1c7402f9a82e9e402dfcc2afa81b1d8f8b81eeb35738bc83ef8266bdcf1b9aa8", "ja": "そのように……人の顔を穴の開くほど見つめるのは、\nどうかと思いますけれど。", "zh": "您这样子……像是要把人家的脸望穿似的，\n我认为不太恰当。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3ac1fdcd02791b0181cf38e2e0aa9df41ce734f67cc5b5827a168f8e92f9efbf", "ja": "あっ……ごめん。\n君があまりに魅力的で、つい。", "zh": "啊……抱歉。\n因为你太有魅力了，我不小心看得出神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "386f114c700f22305172a8fee6c02bd68581f8f20fd7989484338ac02f57c546", "ja": "人を呼びます。", "zh": "来人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d495bfd441d0daca4ec903d121f23ca11f6a04f7beed4a5ee47d7dbb833b5cf0", "ja": "い、いや待ってくれ！\n今のは別にナンパとか、そういう事じゃなくて……！", "zh": "不、不是，先等一下！\n我刚刚不是在搭讪，你误会了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "dca5f3810f0862bde4ae2fe62bf2fff7f8ad6235c808d4f197b110bc11111831", "ja": "実は765プロでは、新しくアイドルに\nなってくれる子を探しているんだ。", "zh": "其实我们765艺能正在寻找\n合适的女孩来成为新的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "815b1792c5cb820115166362bb08c26be39f6f7827b26e9cf8549684b9f54d16", "ja": "そうですか。\nそれはまた、ご苦労様なことです。", "zh": "原来是这样。\n还真是辛苦您了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d544167b93ece54ffcb2a4a33acbea4d4396671b161e296b92387197baaf465b", "ja": "いや他人事じゃなくて！\n君は……、アイドルに興味ないか！？", "zh": "你别说得事不关己啊！\n你……对偶像有没有兴趣呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "530355141028307e93a82cdb6a851d0a176a64692502af257e96f32becd4edde", "ja": "えっ？　……私が？", "zh": "咦……我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1020_p", "source_sha256": "41b846ae19b9ad2d441bf3a0c22ad9a9ef71ecb81856baaf83d0dc69e80ad82f", "ja": "君をひと目見て感じたんだ。\nこの子なら、アイドルになれるって！", "zh": "我一看到你就感觉到了。\n觉得你肯定能当上偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1022_se", "source_sha256": "68904567df71ab554709498049b234f1d2956756544f14608045e43e81804a5a", "ja": "プルルルル……！", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1ee9aa4a27d6ecdc4a1fdf05dc9c626529f213215c9af2772ae53fcb696634fa", "ja": "ん？　律子から電話……あっ、もう新幹線の時間が！\nくっ、とにかく……！", "zh": "嗯？律子打来的……啊，新干线要开了！\n唔，总之……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_1024", "source_sha256": "488ce1f2933d2d484a47b6f60b38fb019cd0fd7c1679ecae09984178a584556c", "ja": "速攻で名刺を渡す", "zh": "迅速递出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "662497f7c8a76f530d1c95beca1b622db4faf696a1c292d3e131753f6a718247", "ja": "これ！　興味が湧いたら、そこに連絡してほしい！\n俺は本気だから！　それじゃ！", "zh": "名片给你！要是你有兴趣了，就照上面方式联络我！\n我是认真的！再见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f891221d4a097a664c59f7c2a40be643cb38a0385db2cafb24e3de316be8299f", "ja": "あっ、あの……。", "zh": "先、先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "69f3bfdd49c77111104fac0c41d5c46193d53b9877cdb1b8b70beb1e8a58f672", "ja": "そんなん、いきなり言われても……。\nうち……。", "zh": "突然问这种事情……\n人家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2004_null", "source_sha256": "86d44248797b588b656e1881a8c1cf66da25e9a3078a70d64ec3c9b9f54ed0d6", "ja": "1ヶ月後……", "zh": "一个月后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2005_p", "source_sha256": "b3f7aa3c662a597c83dba2bb2819d44192e0469e1e2d0dd583bfa7ab8812f498", "ja": "（今日も39プロジェクトのオーディションだが……\n最近はどうも、ピンとくる子に出会えない）", "zh": "（今天有39PROJECT的甄选……\n但最近一直面试不到合适的人选。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "92d95cc2d7098af76c037aaf0f98fcdca0274ffc46eb3d31329bc8f6a65c0c3b", "ja": "（ここからが勝負所かもしれないな……。\nやっぱり、金沢で会ったあの子にもう一度……ん？）", "zh": "（或许接下来就是关键时刻……\n我看还是再联络一次在金泽遇到的女孩……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4cf917bdfb8a57759e2e4f2e091dad4ceb8fcc4e6c5cf2de0dc7ba97349f85c9", "ja": "ごめんあそばせ。{$P$}という方は、\nこちらだと言われたのですが……あ。", "zh": "打扰了。外面的人说{$P$}先生\n就在这里……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2008_p", "source_sha256": "3c7f5b71e8bcd579e829738d5fcf25b0c7e59fbddcecc96655e2e5dc79ac8f44", "ja": "君は、あの時の……！\n驚いた、来てくれたんだね！", "zh": "你是那时候的……！\n你真的来了，太惊喜了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "422f341929b273ef5f102c553d39780ade84617b55f3517aaa51fdb7b191d9f7", "ja": "あれ？　どうして君が驚いてるんだ？", "zh": "咦？为什么你也满脸惊讶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b9d069a7ded2022664ba97e8973e526da4c03286db0072db980616d03e510a36", "ja": "……本気だからと人を誘っておいて、\n本当に来たら驚かれたことに驚きました。", "zh": "……当初邀请我时明明说过自己是认真的，\n现在我真的来了却又觉得意外，这太令人吃惊了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9f4e1da79c16a867f2a71d8805160faa16c9152d64ae2c541a9d9798f2235ba0", "ja": "あの時、あなたは私をバカにしていたのですか？\nそれとも……、あなたがバカなのですか？", "zh": "难道那个时候你把我当笨蛋耍吗？\n还是说……你才是笨蛋？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2013_p", "source_sha256": "e967ab8159630c97de2d79ceb4c689e960b849c998bf4d8fcbd7ca2b4a78b657", "ja": "ご、ごめん、君をバカにしたわけじゃないんだ。\n俺がバカかどうかは……違うといいなと思う。", "zh": "抱、抱歉，我没有把你当笨蛋的意思。\n至于我是不是笨蛋……我希望不是啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2014_p", "source_sha256": "8a6ce9485efc66c33d563ec0dccdb6d4ac9d0d83e9763910071bf8021eef6663", "ja": "とにかく本当によく来てくれたね。\nやっぱり、アイドルに興味があったのかな？", "zh": "不管怎样，真的很高兴看到你过来。\n所以，你果然对偶像有兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "55ce028b209d4f9d6523adb0ab4a11d521cd1d680fcc9c4661928437171191a3", "ja": "興味……。そうとも言えるとは思いますが、\nそう言い切れるかどうかはわかりません。", "zh": "兴趣……或许也能这么说吧，\n但我无法十分肯定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eb3ba6aa95e27c4cd6262c43f3c1cf222743e7b56ebc50b00b93d6ae93090b34", "ja": "ただ、思い出したのです。すっかり色あせて\n霞んでいた、幼い頃の……たわいもない夢を。", "zh": "我只是回想起来罢了。回想起已经彻底褪色、\n模糊不清、年幼时的……天真梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2017_p", "source_sha256": "3f454c10d3f7f3c081e9a3f0d6a56f251014a4ec5de02ae759f34b6588d4f53d", "ja": "（幼い頃……？）", "zh": "（年幼时……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fff5ebe55f4773c1754d0a0a8e709d159898162130e944d269b65532a7668e96", "ja": "金沢でお会いした時、あなたは本気だと仰いました。\nあらためてうかがいますが……今も、本気ですか？", "zh": "我们在金泽见面时，你说过自己是认真的。\n现在容我再确认一次……你依旧是认真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_2019", "source_sha256": "accccea5a9d348dff887ae6254af0ffbe3b782c2d9de228a1d74954ed8b6f14f", "ja": "本気だ", "zh": "我是认真的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3000_p", "source_sha256": "6b2635649264bb672a956f97271686ecc0cbe9379223fb6c20b60c0f639dbf5e", "ja": "本気だよ。君なら間違いなく、アイドルに……。\nトップアイドルになれると思う！", "zh": "我是认真的。我认为你肯定能当上偶像……\n而且是顶尖偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9ab5a98d3a145180b3c33d51a2331652559b559cca76c36dab3bfc3f4f9f804f", "ja": "そ、そう……ですか。\nよかった、安心いたしました。", "zh": "我、我……明白了。\n太好了，这样我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "06c972fe25c023c583329f67324610f42a5b3a7ad1ec63e7777fea64e26bd761", "ja": "転居の手続きも、転校の手続きも済ませて来ました。\n今さら嘘だと言われたら、どうしたものかと。", "zh": "我已经搬来东京，也办好转学手续了。\n要是你现在才说是骗我，我就走投无路了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3003_p", "source_sha256": "33e937131ca9d821a042f70463f0bda67969f384be5a90717437448d498f08f2", "ja": "そ、そうなんだ……。\n電話で確認してくれればよかったのに。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n其实你先打个电话来确认就好啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "02695f86fde573a69e6307899065d34fa46f44bdc391a03aea17cbd986737dc4", "ja": "それはともかく。\nオーディションはなさらないのですか？", "zh": "那不重要了。\n请问你不开始甄选面试吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3006_p", "source_sha256": "a62552ff358ceaabaf7fe87367e692125636a32bf637fcf85b247ea2e4ad4d4e", "ja": "え？　ああ、君のことは直接スカウトしたんだし、\n必要ないよ。合格おめでとう！", "zh": "呃？哦哦，你是我直接看中的人选，\n没有面试的需要，恭喜你录取了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bbd312bb26a6038766e07a4332577f222632686435d02bb63acc308b7c607fae", "ja": "……っ！", "zh": "……唔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3008_p", "source_sha256": "02dc739c8b57ae9ee28ea9438865787c0e45cf28efadbcefce5b909773fb65c5", "ja": "ん？　ああ、もしかして、オーディションに向けて\n何か練習とかしてきてくれたのかな。", "zh": "嗯？啊啊，莫非你为了准备甄选，\n有练习什么才艺要来表演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3010_p", "source_sha256": "3f9908d37497bd62cda7012b9922ecbb53725415dfa8a66cce02f326bede5b88", "ja": "（してきたのか……）", "zh": "（还真的有啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3011_p", "source_sha256": "dd5220244273f59edc7d334275d8971fe367d8a01b4ad233d7a971a47862df3d", "ja": "えっと……そ、そういえば、名前を聞いてなかったね。\nそれじゃ、自己紹介ぐらいはしてもらおうかな。", "zh": "呃……对、对了，我还不知道你的名字。\n不然，至少请你自我介绍一下好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f48ffd61b8bfc59f6c97316ea7a815fa2b109f20f8f5fcf5085fdd6c4c51a6eb", "ja": "あ、そうですね……。そこまで仰るのでしたら、\n致し方ありません。それでは……。", "zh": "啊，自我介绍是吗……既然你这么坚持，\n那就没办法了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f20e9efdd8408c9e17516a64bf2a53e691022127c09591b91212a37f882c81f2", "ja": "白石紬と申します。\nこれからどうぞ、よろしくお願い致します。", "zh": "我叫做白石䌷。\n今后还要请你多多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3014_p", "source_sha256": "4c8c2c23dac7ad74a6da379ebe7bc7c04dfc7944ca9131f97b6b248d997fd838", "ja": "……いい名前だね。\nこちらこそよろしく、紬！", "zh": "……真是好听的名字。\n以后还请多指教，䌷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_051tmg_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_051tmg_001_3015_p", "source_sha256": "59cee8befc9cb4fae7be36d5c8133db1e9f7d3f84b63209bf26864c69c45d84e", "ja": "（本人がやる気になってくれたのなら、願ったり\n叶ったりだ。俺は彼女の未来を紡がないとな！）", "zh": "（她本人这么积极，我当然是求之不得。\n一定要为她谱出光明的未来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
